; Dead counter of the guard AI (byte)
;
; Dead state, verified: #R$63DA reads it at $645E, decrements it when scoring direction 3 (left) and stores it back, and
; reloads it with the game pace #R$7C62 when scoring direction 0 (up), but nothing ever uses the value (the register it
; is read into is overwritten at once and no flag from it is tested; no other code touches $7C64). The watch in the
; simulator shows it counting down from 8 to 1 and reloading, without effect. The loaded value 1 is arbitrary. Probably
; a leftover of an earlier version of the AI.
;
@label=UnusedAiCounter
g$7C64 DEFB $01
